<title>USA: CCC crop loan interest rates set for May - USDA.</title>
<headline>CCC crop loan interest rates set for May - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department on Thursday said interest rates for Commodity Credit Corp crop loans made during May would be six percent for 1995 and earlier crops and seven percent for 1996 crops.</p>
<p>Both rates are up 0.375 percentage point from April levels.</p>
<p>The 1996 farm policy law requires that interest rates on crop loans for 1996 and succeeding years be one percentage point higher than a formula in use in 1995. The requirement does not affect crops harvested in previous years.</p>
</text>
